t_right":" Specifications: Category Proliant Hard Drive Sub-Category 10K Generation SAS NHP Part Number 508429-001-10Pack Products ID 455695 Capacity 400GB Interface Serial Attached SCSI (SAS) Enclosure Internal Drive Dimensions 3.5 inches x 1/3H (Low Profile) Spindle Speed 10000RPM External Data Transfer 3072MB/s Seek Time 3.5ms HotSwap No Manufacturer Hewlett Packard Pre-Failure Warranty Yes Hot Swap Tray Not Included Package Qty 1 508429-001 Compatible Servers: DL120 G5 DL120 G6 G7 ML110 G4 ML110 G5 ML115 G1 ML115 G5 ML150 G5 ML150 G6 G7 ML330 G6"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":131,"row":{"pair_id":"2273550#13196164","label":0,"id_left":2273550,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":577493,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Intel Giabit CT Desktop PCI Express Network Adapter\" \" Intel Adapter - EXPI9301CT Ethernet Adapters CDW.com","description_left":"\"For PCs with PCI Express (PCIe) slots, the Intel Gigabit CT Desktop Adapter offers technology for maximizing system performance and increasing end-user productivity. Specifically, the Intel Gigabit CT Desktop Adapter uses auto- negotiation to ensure the adapter runs at the highest available network speed (10, 100, or 1000 Mbps), and maintains full bandwidth capacity with the dedicated bandwidth of a PCIe input/output (I/O) bus to provide connectivity you can count on. Based on the low-power Intel 82574L Gigabit Ethernet Controller, this desktop adapter offers optimal performance in a low-cost, low-power, compact profile. Teaming support and an array of other advanced features enable customers to use this adapter as an entry-level server adapter as well.\" ","price_left":"\"$\", \"39.99\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13196164,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":307548,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"StarTech.com PCIe 300 Mbps Wireless N Network Adapter 802.11n/g 2T2R\" \" StarTech.com 2T2R - PEX300WN2X2 Adapters & Accessories CDWG.com","description_right":"\"Add high speed Wireless-N connectivity to a desktop PC through PCI Express. The PEX300WN2X2 PCI Express Wireless N Card (PCIe x1) adds high speed wireless network connectivity to almost any PCI Express-enabled desktop/workstation PC. Using a 2T2R (2 Transmitter/2 Receiver) design over the 2.4GHz frequency, this PCIe wireless card provides up to 300Mbps of data bandwidth over an 802.11n network, while improving signal reception and range.Backward compatible with 802.11b/g networks (11/54Mbps), this WiFi N adapter offers a versatile wireless networking solution with support for standard and advanced security options such as WEP, WPA and WPA2, along with wireless Quality of Service (QoS) support and quick and easy setup through WPS.\" ","price_right":"\"$\", \"21.94\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":132,"row":{"pair_id":"15197137#9873026","label":0,"id_left":15197137,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":14269885,"brand_left":"\"HP Enterprise\"","title_left":" \"Null\" \"300876-B21 BL20PG2 Xeon 2.8GHz 512 1P\"","description_left":" \"Description: BL20PG2 Xeon 2.8GHz 512 1P Blade \"","price_left":"\"USD\", \"$661.55\"","specTableContent_left":" Specifications: Category Proliant Server Sub-Category BL20 Generation G2 Part Number 300876-B21 Products ID 6181 Form Factor Blade Processor Type Xeon 2.8 GHz Processors Qty 1 Installed Memory 512 MB Platform PC Bus Speed 400 MHz Maximum RAM 4 GB RAID Support RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 10, RAID 5 Networking Type Network Adapter Data Link Protocol Ethernet, Fast Ethernet, Gigabit Etherne","id_right":9873026,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":8506240,"brand_right":"\"HP Enterprise\"","title_right":" \"308724-001 DL360R G3 X2.8GHz 512K 1GB\", \"Null\" Price 308724-001\" 1GB Wholesale 308724-001","description_right":"\"Description: Proliant DL360R G3 Xeon 2.8GHz/512K-400fsb 1GBHewlett-Packard Part# 308724-001 \n\" ","price_right":null,"spec